WEBVTT

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.950
My Daddy by Noriko Takuya.

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:08.750
Third grade, class four.

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:13.520
I think my daddy is one of the greatest men in the whole wide world.

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:14.980
He works re-

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.340
I feel hard to protect Earth from way, way up among the stars.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:22.360
Sometimes he likes to tell me about his special spaceship.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:26.350
He says it's probably the fastest one in the entire universe.

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:29.970
It's called the Luxion, and it's made for ba-

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.400
Not only that, but my daddy's the captain!

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:40.180
Someday, when I grow up, I want to be the captain of a big important spaceship, just like him.

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:44.150
Then we can be way, way up among the stars together!

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:50.200
December 20th, 2015.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:52.160
Overcast skies.

00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:54.530
My father is gone.

00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:55.510
Forever.

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:57.670
They tell me it happened yesterday.

00:01:00.508 --> 00:01:02.388
He was on a mission in deep space.

00:01:03.292 --> 00:01:04.912
Apparently the ship was attacked.

00:01:05.596 --> 00:01:07.136
Alien hostels, they said.

00:01:08.028 --> 00:01:09.448
Or so the story goes.

00:01:10.268 --> 00:01:11.468
I'm not convinced.

00:01:12.284 --> 00:01:13.364
He's out there somewhere.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:15.380
That's what my heart says.

00:01:18.268 --> 00:01:19.368
One way or the other.

00:01:19.964 --> 00:01:21.044
I'm gonna find out.

00:01:22.876 --> 00:01:24.716
And I can think of no better way.

00:01:25.372 --> 00:01:27.212
than following in his footsteps.

00:02:02.332 --> 00:02:03.352
In the midst of all this

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:03.920
Oh you

